1. DEFINITIONS

1.1. "Software" means the script RouteDrawer.jsx, the installer
     RouteDrawer-Setup.exe, the project website (the docs folder), and the
     icons, graphics, texts and documentation (including the README) published
     in the repository https://github.com/T1desLuck/RouteDrawer, and any parts
     and copies of them. The Fira Sans font bundled with the website is not
     part of the Software and is distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
1.2. "Author" means tidesluck@icloud.com. "Rights holder" means
     ИП Барков Никита Сергеевич (individual entrepreneur).
1.3. "You" means anyone who receives or uses the Software.
1.4. "Output" means the images, layers, documents and other materials You create
     with the Software.
1.5. "Modification" means any change to the Software: editing code or texts;
     changing, replacing or removing resources and metadata; translating;
     decompiling and then editing; repackaging; combining with other programs
     or installers; creating derivative works. Changing values in the script's
     own settings window is not a Modification.


2. WHAT IS ALLOWED WITHOUT SEPARATE CONSENT

2.1. Install and use the Software free of charge on any number of computers,
     for personal and commercial purposes, including in an organization's work.
2.2. The Output belongs to You. You need not credit the Software or the Author
     on the Output.
2.3. Read and study the script's source code and the documentation.
2.4. Pass exact, unmodified copies of the complete Software (script, installer
     and this license file) to others free of charge, subject to Sections 3
     and 4.
2.5. View and copy the repository using GitHub features (including "fork")
     within GitHub's Terms of Service. Copies and forks remain subject to this
     license; changes to them are allowed only under Section 5.


3. MANDATORY ATTRIBUTION

Whenever You pass on, publish or show the Software to others (archive, website,
social networks, messenger, media, etc.) You must:

3.1. state the name "Route Drawer", the Author (tidesluck@icloud.com) and the
     Rights holder (ИП Барков Никита Сергеевич);
3.2. include the full text of this license and leave the authorship information
     in the files, in the installer's properties and in the documentation
     unchanged;
3.3. link to the source: https://github.com/T1desLuck/RouteDrawer.


4. PROHIBITIONS

Without the Author's written permission it is prohibited to:

4.1. Distribute, publish, provide, sell or rent out the Software (in whole or in
     part) under Your own name, on behalf of a third party, under another name
     or without crediting the Author; or present the Software or any part of it
     as Your own work. The Software may be distributed only under the Author's
     name and in accordance with Section 3.
4.2. Modify the Software (see Section 5).
4.3. Remove, hide or alter authorship information, the name, the license or file
     metadata.
4.4. Sell the Software, charge for obtaining, downloading or supporting it, or
     include it in paid subscriptions, paid bundles or commercial products.
