4.5. Use the Author's name, the Rights holder's name, the name "Route Drawer",
     the icon and graphics to designate other products, or suggest that the
     Author endorses or supports Your product.
4.6. Present a modified version as the original.


5. MODIFICATION — ONLY WITH THE AUTHOR'S PERMISSION

5.1. Modification is allowed only with the Author's prior written permission
     (including by e-mail). Send Your request to tidesluck@icloud.com describing
